ed without a main JAR, so compile its published sources.\n+    accessorsSmartSources \"net.minidev:accessors-smart:$libraryVersion:sources\"\n+    accessorsSmartCompileClasspath 'org.ow2.asm:asm:8.0.1'\n+    testImplementation accessorsSmartJarFiles\n+    testImplementation 'org.ow2.asm:asm:8.0.1'\n     testImplementation 'org.assertj:assertj-core:3.22.0'\n }\n \ndiff --git a/metadata/net.minidev/accessors-smart/index.json b/metadata/net.minidev/accessors-smart/index.json\nindex c22b245792..37fb669d82 100644\n--- a/metadata/net.minidev/accessors-smart/index.json\n+++ b/metadata/net.minidev/accessors-smart/index.json\n@@ -3,6 +3,11 @@\n     \"latest\" : true,\n     \"auto-update\" : true,\n     \"metadata-version\" : \"2.4.3\",\n+    \"source-code-url\" : \"https://repo1.maven.org/maven2/net/minidev/accessors-smart/$version$/accessors-smart-$version$-sources.jar\",\n+    \"repository-url\" : \"https://github.com/netplex/json-smart-v2\",\n+    \"test-code-url\" : \"N/A\",\n+    \"documentation-url\" : \"https://repo1.maven.org/maven2/net/minidev/accessors-smart/$version$/accessors-smart-$version$-javadoc.jar\",\n+    \"description\" : \"accessors-smart provides an ASM-based helper for generating fast bean accessors for getter, setter, constructor, and field access operations. It is used by json-smart to reduce the overhead of Java reflection when mapping and converting object properties.\",\n     \"tested-versions\" : [\n       \"2.4.3\"\n     ],\ntests/src/net.minidev/accessors-smart/2.4.3/src/test/java/net_minidev/accessors_smart/AccessorTest.java\ntests/src/net.minidev/accessors-smart/2.4.3/src/test/java/net_minidev/accessors_smart/BeansAccessTest.java\ntests/src/net.minidev/accessors-smart/2.4.3/src/test/java/net_minidev/accessors_smart/DynamicClassLoaderTest.java\n"}], "isError": false, "timestamp": 1791239196595}}
